# The stdlib jar is taken from whatever Kotlin distribution the checkout provisions (README.md);
# only the jar is ignored, so the directory itself stays in the tree for the copy to land in.
lib/*.jar
# Bazel's generated convenience symlinks, anchored so a real `bazel-…` source file is not hidden.
/bazel-bin
/bazel-out
/bazel-smoke
/bazel-testlogs
# Rewritten in place by whichever Bazel the reader runs (9 and 8 use different lock versions), so
# committing it guarantees a dirty tree for one of them.
MODULE.bazel.lock
